<!--
  The Connection Checker (sdk/archive-panel.js): how the Internet Archive lookups went, above the Record Cabinet,
  opened only by tapping its Archive Connection button. A flat VR menu: 1 UIKit px is one of Meta's dp (1/16 of a
  degree) at 0.7 m, about where you stand to tap that button (0.76 mm a px), so the whole panel is 560 x 560 px
  (42.8 cm). The site's colors (styles.css) and Jost.

    FRAME      560 x 560, dark brown, 5 px round the title and the green.
    TITLE      550 x 50, "CONNECTION CHECKER" in Jost italic, 20 px, cream (the italic is set in sdk/archive-panel.js:
               UIKitML only takes its own font names, and Jost italic is made in sdk/fonts.js).
    ✕          60 x 60 (46 mm), red with a 5 px dark brown stroke, on the top right corner, drawn over the panel
               (z-index 1: no more, or a fingertip picks it from further away: sdk/panels.js fairTouch).
    GROUND     Verdigris green with its art-deco lines (ui/checker-lines.svg), drawn under the boxes and buttons
               (their z-index). The lines don't write depth (set in code), or they'd show through the boxes.
    REPORT     two cream boxes with a 5 px dark brown stroke, 472 x 204 (the connection and the records) and 472 x 118
               (the Record Cabinet), filled in code. Their text is 20 px (Meta's body text, as the site panel),
               Jost regular, dark brown, set to the left.
    BUTTONS    Reload and Done: circles 90 across (69 mm), dark brown with a 5 px cream stroke, their words 20 px Jost
               regular in cream, in italic capitals as in the design (set in code, as the title), centered (pushed down by half their padding-top: UIKit sets a line of Jost a little
               high in its box).

  TAPPING (sdk/input.js tappable): each button is one pressable thing, words included; its `press` sits on the button
  itself (set in sdk/archive-panel.js). Nothing here scrolls. The panel needs the ids page, title and close
  (sdk/panels.js).
-->
<style>
  .panel {
    flex-direction: column;
    width: 560px;
    height: 560px;
    padding: 5px;
    background-color: #24150d;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
  .bar {
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 550px;
    height: 50px;
    background-color: #24150d;
  }
  .title {
    color: #F2E8D5;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: normal;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    padding-top: 6px;
  }
  .close {
    z-index: 1;
    position-type: absolute;
    position-top: -17px;
    position-right: -14px;
    width: 60px;
    height: 60px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: #8C2B22;
    border-width: 5px;
    border-color: #24150d;
    border-radius: 30px;
  }
  .close:hover {
    background-color: #a8382d;
  }
  .close:active {
    background-color: #6e2019;
  }
  .x {
    color: #F2E8D5;
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: medium;
    text-align: center;
    padding-top: 8px;
  }
  .page {
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 550px;
    height: 500px;
    padding-top: 30px;
    background-color: #5F7A6B;
  }
  .lines {
    position-type: absolute;
    position-top: 0px;
    position-left: 0px;
    width: 550px;
    height: 500px;
  }
  .box {
    z-index: 1;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: flex-start;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 472px;
    padding-left: 22px;
    padding-right: 22px;
    background-color: #F2E8D5;
    border-width: 5px;
    border-color: #24150d;
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .report {
    height: 204px;
  }
  .cabinet {
    height: 118px;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }
  .buttons {
    z-index: 1;
    flex-direction: row;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 472px;
    margin-top: 18px;
    gap: 187px;
  }
  .button {
    width: 90px;
    height: 90px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: #24150d;
    border-width: 5px;
    border-color: #F2E8D5;
    border-radius: 45px;
  }
  .button:hover {
    background-color: #4a3222;
  }
  .button:active {
    background-color: #6b4a36;
  }
  .label {
    color: #F2E8D5;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: normal;
    text-align: center;
    width: 100%;
    word-break: keep-all;
    padding-top: 11px;
  }
</style>
<div id="panel" class="panel">
  <div class="bar">
    <span id="title" class="title">CONNECTION CHECKER</span>
  </div>
  <div id="page" class="page">
    <svg id="lines" class="lines" src="ui/checker-lines.svg"></svg>
    <div id="report" class="box report"></div>
    <div id="cabinet" class="box cabinet"></div>
    <div class="buttons">
      <div id="reload" class="button"><span id="reload-label" class="label">RELOAD</span></div>
      <div id="done" class="button"><span id="done-label" class="label">DONE</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div id="close" class="close"><span class="x">X</span></div>
</div>
